  "acceptance_notes": [
    "Fresh full headless run 40333259525 retains actual Windows/Linux, Native/Java, BASE/PINOUT and loader identities; no prior runtime acceptance is relabeled as new.",
    "The separate graphical cohort retains twelve real client scenarios, exact tested world hashes, helper sources, native Save and Quit and dedicated save/stop outcomes.",
    "Supplemental pin observations retain actual player rays, PG labels, native wire input and server-selected endpoints on regulator upper posts, stacked ends and capacitor pins.",
    "The mod jar excludes GameTests and fixtures. All earlier core coverage remains in the separate companion with five added targeting regressions.",
    "The 14,650-node benchmark native save bytes are preserved from 0.2.2; only release/jar metadata changed. No performance benchmark was run, and 20 TPS remains uncertified.",
    "Goggles alone keep their existing targeting. The targeted checks do not certify every CEE item or arbitrary addon geometry. Electrical warnings remain retained in their original logs and observation summaries."
  ]
